        },
        {
          "text": "expert in Stealth",
          "predicate": [
            {
              "gte": ["skill:stealth:rank", 2]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "action": {
        "cost": "one",
        "requirementsText": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "You're wearing your Mask Familiar in its mask form, and it has the Skilled (Religion) familiar ability."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "d3c542d1-1951-57cc-b047-9efa2f6dcb83",
    "pack": "claws-of-the-tyrant",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:cut-them-down-burn-them-out",
    "name": "Cut them Down, Burn them Out",
    "level": 18,
    "rarity": "common",
    "traits": ["archetype"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "claws-of-the-tyrant",
        "page": 111,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=7748"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Inspired by the sixth line of the Crimson Oath, when you oppose the enemies of Lastwall, you aim to excise the rot from the land itself. Make a Strike against an undead creature using a weapon with which you have master proficiency. On a success, in addition to the attack's other effects, the creature takes a –2 status penalty to the DC of any curses, diseases, or poisons it can inflict for 1 round. On a critical success, the undead creature takes the –2 status penalty for 1 round, then a –1 status penalty for an additional round."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.O8mfeWtUogB74J9E"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Knight Reclaimant Dedication; master proficiency in a weapon"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "prerequisiteClauses": [
        {
          "text": "Knight Reclaimant Dedication",
          "predicate": ["feat:knight-reclaimant-dedication"]
        },
        {
          "text": "master proficiency in a weapon"
        }
      ],
      "action": {
        "cost": "one"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "2d3573cd-0256-5caf-8b01-3f6b21d4f2ce",
    "pack": "claws-of-the-tyrant",
    "kind": "feat",
    "slug": "feat:faith-in-the-fallen",
    "name": "Faith in the Fallen",
    "level": 16,
    "rarity": "uncommon",
    "traits": ["archetype"],
    "sources": [
      {
        "kind": "book",
        "book": "claws-of-the-tyrant",
        "page": 113,
        "aon": "https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=7759"
      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Access",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " You're a member of the Vellumis Scholars."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The Gravelands are full of fallen spirits seeking to move on, and you consider it your obligation to assist in that regard. You gain the ability to store spirit wisps in your body, becoming a living "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "spirit dwelling",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (see the Exorcist archetype). Each day during your daily preparations, your "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "spirit dwelling",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " attracts a spirit wisp who comes to dwell inside. If your "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "spirit dwelling",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " contains no wisps, you can spend 10 minutes in a minor ritual to cast your "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "spirit dwelling",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " around an area and attract another wisp. Additionally, you gain a spirit wisp when a haunt or incorporeal undead creature is destroyed within 30 feet of you."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "13009b76-b08c-560f-9de0-fba2c2b7500a"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " action."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every day before your daily preparations, any spirit wisps remaining within your "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "spirit dwelling",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " from the previous day are purified and can continue along the River of Souls."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "key": "GrantItem",
        "item": "13009b76-b08c-560f-9de0-fba2c2b7500a"
      }
    ],
    "externalIds": {
      "foundry": "Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.7w8SOlLlFYOBYC5Y"
    },
    "data": {
      "category": "class",
      "prerequisites": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Magaambyan Attendant Dedication"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
