      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You have learned much of what the Gravelands need and are confident in your ability to speak for them. You gain the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "b14bc078-c689-57e5-b54d-9a11486ec899"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " archetype feat, even if you normally couldn't take another dedication feat until you take more feats from your current archetype. You can benefit from the following Gravelands terrain attunement when in the Gravelands."
          }
        ]
      },
