        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gravelands",
            "marks": ["strong"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (vitality) You gain a +1 status bonus to saving throws against the spells and abilities of haunts and undead creatures for 1 round."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9c38e4c6-9755-5aea-ad67-2928375df809"
