            "type": "text",
            "text": "Though the city of Vigil itself has been destroyed, you will carry on its warrior spirit to the end of your days. The value of your "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "c0cd649a-7029-5174-a5b4-678f51598dec"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition at which you die increases by 1 (normally to dying 5, or dying 6 if you have "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "730b86b0-c740-5759-ba8b-82ae1fede883"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "), and the reduction to your maximum dying value from the "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "cd164d22-2d8e-5fd2-b8b2-03e1360df1e7"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " condition is 1 less severe (to a minimum of 0)."
          }
